1
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,940
This is the divine artifact left by the Saintess of the Tides.

2
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:50,960
The God-Sealing Mirror.

3
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,650
If it belongs to the Saintess,

4
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,460
why can't she control it or resist its power?

5
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:55,940
Because she

6
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,260
isn't the Saintess of the Tides at all.

7
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,780
In her true form,

8
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,010
she's nothing more

9
00:01:06,030 --> 00:01:07,220
than a weed that gained a spirit.

10
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:08,730
A thousand years ago,

11
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:10,810
she hid inside the Saintess's Shrine.

12
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,220
Then, by a stroke of luck,

13
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:15,060
she took human form using the Mystical Core the Saintess left behind.

14
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:16,250
She passed herself off as the Saintess

15
00:01:16,470 --> 00:01:17,530
and infiltrated the immortal sects.

16
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:20,720
Had I found the God-Sealing Mirror sooner,

17
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,500
I wouldn't have let her get this far.

18
00:01:25,470 --> 00:01:26,810
We were all fooled

19
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:27,980
by a worthless weed!

20
00:01:28,470 --> 00:01:29,700
And we nearly lost our lives!

21
00:01:39,670 --> 00:01:40,290
This Devil's Heart

22
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:42,890
was formed from Qi Fengyin's blood.

23
00:01:43,910 --> 00:01:44,940
It was tainted by dark energy,

24
00:01:45,670 --> 00:01:46,870
which clouded everyone's judgment.

25
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,520
That woman has been plotting all along

26
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,220
to destroy the immortal sects.

27
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:52,620
Her intentions are evil! She must be eliminated!

28
00:01:57,110 --> 00:01:57,780
She got away!

29
00:01:59,190 --> 00:02:00,060
If the Saintess who emerged

30
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,340
from the shrine was an impostor,

31
00:02:01,670 --> 00:02:02,860
then where is

32
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,810
the real Saintess of the Tides?

33
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:36,620
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

34
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:44,620
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

35
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:49,900
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

36
00:02:53,580 --> 00:03:01,140
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

37
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:08,260
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

38
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:16,140
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

39
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:24,180
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

40
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:32,300
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

41
00:03:37,060 --> 00:03:38,860
[Blossom in Darkness]

42
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:40,860
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

43
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:43,860
[Episode 22]

44
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,370
Qi Fengyin!

45
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:58,370
Qi Fengyin!

46
00:03:59,040 --> 00:03:59,410
Qi Fengyin!

47
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:00,250
I'm alive.

48
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,900
Next time you try to help me,

49
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:08,380
think about yourself too,

50
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:08,820
will you?

51
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:10,410
You didn't tell me anything.

52
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:12,130
You suffered so much on your own.

53
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,450
Do you really think my life

54
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:15,220
matters more than yours?

55
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:31,170
Then I'll be more careful next time.

56
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,850
I'll try not to make you worry.

57
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,730
You'd better keep your word.

58
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,170
No need to look anymore.

59
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:56,540
His Lordship's Devil's Heart is still there!

60
00:04:59,270 --> 00:04:59,930
I knew it.

61
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:01,700
I knew you'd both make it through.

62
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,410
Youyou, are you okay?

63
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:05,050
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

64
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:06,540
A few beams of divine light can't hurt me.

65
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,780
It's all Duyao's fault!

66
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:10,050
Just wait till I get my hands on her.

67
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,610
I'll tear her to pieces!

68
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,340
I can't figure out

69
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,170
what Duyao's really after.

70
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:16,250
Why did she spare you

71
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,540
only to slaughter

72
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,220
those immortal sect members?

73
00:05:18,390 --> 00:05:19,340
I have no idea.

74
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,610
At first, I thought

75
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,850
she wanted my Devil's Heart.

76
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,410
But in the end,

77
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:27,340
she only took a few drops of blood.

78
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:30,370
Who cares about all

79
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:31,490
the fighting among the immortal sects?

80
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:33,220
It's got nothing to do with us.

81
00:05:33,270 --> 00:05:34,140
Isn't that a good thing?

82
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,980
Now that everyone's safe,

83
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:38,100
let's get out of this awful place.

84
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,410
You're so clumsy.

85
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,700
You'd mess up anything you tried.

86
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,780
When we go collect the world's malice,

87
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,100
you'll probably cause all kinds of trouble.

88
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,100
So I'll be generous

89
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:02,250
and stick with you for now.

90
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:05,700
Are you sure?

91
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,700
When have I ever lied to...

92
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,020
Anyway,

93
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,700
it's settled.

94
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:14,980
But first,

95
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:16,540
I need to tell my master.

96
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:17,780
I don't want him worrying.

97
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,780
It's a deal, then!

98
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:20,580
We'll wait for you at the foot of the mountain.

99
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,410
See you down there.

100
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,850
M-Master.

101
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,810
I told you before.

102
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,900
You are never to have

103
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,340
anything to do with Qi Fengyin again.

104
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:02,900
I...

105
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,610
Come back to Luoshen Valley with me.

106
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,580
Master.

107
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:15,140
Please, let me explain, Master.

108
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:16,810
I know I was wrong

109
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:17,460
to lie to you.

110
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,660
You can punish me however you want.

111
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,580
I'll accept it.

112
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:20,810
But Qi Fengyin

113
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,220
has saved my life over and over.

114
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,540
How could I just stand by

115
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,580
and let him die?

116
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,540
Master, didn't you teach me

117
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:28,580
that evil without ill intent deserves no punishment?

118
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,290
Qi Fengyin

119
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,610
isn't the monster

120
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:31,460
everyone makes him out to be.

121
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:32,290
Master.

122
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,340
I promise you.

123
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,050
Once I've helped him collect all the world's malice,

124
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,830
and he's removed the mystical flower from my body,

125
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:38,410
I...

126
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,410
I'll never see him again.

127
00:07:45,830 --> 00:07:47,340
Help him collect all the world's malice?

128
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:49,220
Do you even know

129
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,780
what you're saying?

130
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:00,580
What is this?

131
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,780
The Book of Lost Divinity.

132
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:07,540
It reveals the past

133
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,810
and foretells the future.

134
00:08:42,670 --> 00:08:43,130
That can't be!

135
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:43,850
Master.

136
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,250
Qi Fengyin has a good heart.

137
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,060
He's helped me save

138
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,770
so many lives.

139
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,820
He only absorbs the world's malice

140
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,650
to gain enough power

141
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:50,850
to revive the mystical flower's owner.

142
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,770
He has no desire to become the Devil Incarnate.

143
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,300
He's never wanted to destroy the world.

144
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,730
You believe he has a good heart?

145
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,940
Everything he says and does around you

146
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,890
could be an act.

147
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:11,700
You can't see someone's true nature just by looking at them.

148
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:13,770
Yamao.

149
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:16,460
How can you question the Book of Lost Divinity

150
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,130
that can reveal both the

151
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,100
past and the future based on what you see?

152
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,890
Even if the prophecy is divine,

153
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:24,850
the future hasn't happened yet.

154
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,220
Things can still change.

155
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,220
Our choices can change the course of fate.

156
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:29,420
I believe in him.

157
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:30,940
He won't lose sight of who he is.

158
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,890
You're too involved to see the truth.

159
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,130
What you don't realize

160
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,770
is that from the moment

161
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,700
the mystical flower was planted,

162
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,820
your life force has been feeding it.

163
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:52,220
You and the flower cannot coexist.

164
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,010
Master...

165
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:57,610
I don't understand.

166
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:58,850
How can you not understand?

167
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,610
The day the mystical flower blooms

168
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,460
is the day you, its host,

169
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,460
will die.

170
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:11,010
So that's why every time I watered the flower,

171
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,700
I grew weaker.

172
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,300
It wasn't

173
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,610
Qi Fengyin's dark energy hurting me.

174
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,650
It was the mystical flower

175
00:10:19,670 --> 00:10:20,700
using my flesh and blood to come back to life.

176
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:28,580
If he truly cares about you,

177
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:30,940
why would he keep this from you?

178
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,730
He's already forgotten

179
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:34,530
everything that happened before.

180
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:36,370
Maybe...

181
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,020
Maybe he doesn't know anything about the mystical flower either.

182
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:39,820
How long will you

183
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,580
keep fooling yourself?

184
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:42,370
You're getting weaker by the day.

185
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,730
Your very lifeblood is being drained.

186
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,650
He waters the mystical flower himself.

187
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:46,770
How could he not know?

188
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:48,460
But even when he was trapped in Crystal Prison,

189
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,580
he risked everything to come help me.

190
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,650
He's done so much for me.

191
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,010
Was it for you

192
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,700
or for the mystical flower?

193
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:02,490
Yamao.

194
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:03,100
No.

195
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,340
I don't believe it.

196
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:07,850
It's the one I recovered

197
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:08,650
from the black dragon.

198
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,530
Yamao?

199
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:34,650
My mind is in such turmoil

200
00:12:35,670 --> 00:12:37,300
that I can't tell what's real anymore.

201
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:39,250
I can't separate the past from the present.

202
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,220
Perhaps

203
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,700
only when I reclaim the last of the world's malice

204
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,060
will everything finally become clear.

205
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,980
What's taking Yamao so long?

206
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:00,850
Why isn't she back yet?

207
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,060
She just went to tell her master.

208
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,580
What's taking so long?

209
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,250
Should we go get her?

210
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:07,980
Let's wait a little longer.

211
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:19,140
[Strive to Cultivate Noble Virtue]

212
00:13:30,390 --> 00:13:30,980
Yamao?

213
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,610
Today at Mount Qihuang,

214
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,850
you saved us all from disaster.

215
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:35,460
But didn't you return to Luoshen Valley?

216
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,610
Why have you come back?

217
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,180
I need to ask you something.

218
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:40,940
Nine hundred years ago,

219
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,490
in Luoliang Demon Capital,

220
00:13:43,150 --> 00:13:44,300
when Qi Fengyin was about to use dark energy

221
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,300
to water the mystical flower,

222
00:13:45,910 --> 00:13:46,820
you seemed to have something to say

223
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:48,060
and even tried to stop him.

224
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:49,530
Why?

225
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,460
After we returned to the present,

226
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:55,940
you kept telling me

227
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:56,850
not to seek out Qi Fengyin

228
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,220
or have anything to do with him.

229
00:13:58,550 --> 00:13:59,770
Did you already know

230
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,100
the flower was draining my life to sustain itself?

231
00:14:05,030 --> 00:14:05,420
I...

232
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,730
I never meant to hide it from you.

233
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,220
I have one last question.

234
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:13,730
Qi Fengyin...

235
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,490
When did he find out?

236
00:14:24,870 --> 00:14:26,100
Back in Luoliang Demon Capital,

237
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,460
Shen Wangyan discovered how the mystical flower's spell worked.

238
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,300
I happened to be there

239
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,370
when he told Qi Fengyin.

240
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:34,060
I didn't know

241
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,340
what your relationship really is.

242
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:36,940
I didn't dare say anything.

243
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:38,130
I was afraid it'd cause trouble.

244
00:14:38,750 --> 00:14:39,440
I wanted to see

245
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,490
how he'd handle it.

246
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:41,650
But I never expected him

247
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:43,730
to actually hurt you.

248
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:04,370
I can't believe he lied to me, too.

249
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,700
My Lord, what are you doing?

250
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:18,300
You don't have to hide it.

251
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:19,250
I saw everything.

252
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,250
You're making a back scratcher.

253
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:29,460
Doesn't it look

254
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,700
like a feather-shaped hairpin?

255
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:32,180
Who'd wear something that ugly

256
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:32,960
in their hair?

257
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,010
Even a cheap one from the market

258
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:35,890
would look better than that.

259
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,010
You're making it for Yamao, aren't you?

260
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:48,490
Her old hairpin broke.

261
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,650
I want to give her a new one.

262
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:54,100
She's going to love it.

263
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:56,010
That little sprout on her head

264
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:56,890
looked just like a white feather.

265
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,490
Ever since your mystical flower replaced it,

266
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,650
she's been upset about losing it.

267
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:00,940
This will make her so happy.

268
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:04,060
Yamao!

269
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,340
You're finally back!

270
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,890
The wounds on my face have healed.

271
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,220
I came to see you one last time.

272
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,460
Once we've settled things between us,

273
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,890
I'll pretend we never met.

274
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:36,940
Why?

275
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,060
Why?

276
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,100
Why don't you ask yourself

277
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,730
what you've done?

278
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:49,980
So you came to see me

279
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:52,250
because of the mystical flower?

280
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:53,670
You knew all along

281
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:55,100
that the flower was tied to my lifeblood.

282
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,700
The day it blooms

283
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,220
is the day I die.

284
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:01,820
Isn't that right?

285
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,660
Even knowing that,

286
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,730
you still chose the flower over me.

287
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:13,140
I spent a thousand years on Mount Qihuang.

288
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,220
Everything I did was for it.

289
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,570
I can't just give it up.

290
00:17:18,070 --> 00:17:19,050
But my life?

291
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,290
You can give that up?

292
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:30,220
I'll find a way to make it up to you.

293
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,660
I was such a fool.

294
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,770
I was foolish enough

295
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,490
to risk my life for you

296
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,980
again and again,

297
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,700
to stand by you no matter what,

298
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:45,140
and betray the immortal sects over and over.

299
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:46,570
But you?

300
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,660
What am I to you?

301
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,010
Yamao.

302
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:52,090
Don't touch me!

303
00:17:59,510 --> 00:18:01,360
Do you think I'm a joke?

304
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,940
I've never thought that.

305
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:05,530
Yamao.

306
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,300
Have you forgotten how His Lordship

307
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:08,290
always protected you?

308
00:18:08,830 --> 00:18:10,770
Could this all be a misunderstanding?

309
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,250
How could I forget?

310
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,220
Back on Mount Jigu,

311
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:18,940
you used every last bit of your power

312
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,860
to change the weather

313
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,330
and put out the flames

314
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,770
that had burned for ten thousand years.

315
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:29,730
I'd never seen you

316
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:30,900
so desperate before.

317
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,940
You even sacrificed part of your primal spirit

318
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,700
to create a soul whistle

319
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:37,380
to protect me.

320
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:41,530
I'll get you out of here.

321
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,770
You said my safety

322
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,250
mattered more than anything in the world.

323
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,420
And I believed you.

324
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:53,940
You're the biggest

325
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,250
liar I've ever met.

326
00:18:57,110 --> 00:18:59,290
All you ever really cared about

327
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,570
was this stupid flower!

328
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,460
Apart from this,

329
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:09,730
I've never lied to you.

330
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,290
Let me ask you one last thing.

331
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,770
If I hadn't found out,

332
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,490
would you have told me the truth

333
00:19:19,350 --> 00:19:21,010
before the mystical flower bloomed?

334
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,010
I owe you nothing.

335
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:42,730
As for us...

336
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:45,290
This is where it ends.

337
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:50,660
Yamao...

338
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,700
Take one more step,

339
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:23,330
and I'll tear the mystical flower apart.

340
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,700
Qi Fengyin,

341
00:20:29,830 --> 00:20:31,980
we're enemies from this day forward.

342
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:35,050
I never want to see you again.

343
00:20:49,750 --> 00:20:50,290
My Lord.

344
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,290
Was everything Yamao said true?

345
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:58,980
It's true.

346
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:02,860
But I can't let her leave.

347
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:04,380
Yamao is

348
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,730
furious with you right now.

349
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,460
She won't see you.

350
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,090
I have to see her anyway.

351
00:21:14,660 --> 00:21:17,380
[Moonlight Retreat]

352
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,180
Yamao.

353
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:38,460
It seems

354
00:21:39,350 --> 00:21:40,620
you've learned the whole truth.

355
00:21:41,550 --> 00:21:42,290
Master.

356
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:45,660
I think I really was wrong.

357
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,770
Now that you've seen your mistake,

358
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,530
there's no need to dwell on the past.

359
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:55,700
Yamao.

360
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,380
You and Qi Fengyin were never meant to walk the same path.

361
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,090
You don't need to grieve over him.

362
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:09,810
I'm not really sad.

363
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:12,380
And I don't want to cry over him.

364
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:14,860
But...

365
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,620
I don't know why...

366
00:22:19,030 --> 00:22:19,730
Is it because

367
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,660
I trusted the wrong person?

368
00:22:23,350 --> 00:22:25,180
Or because he chose the mystical flower?

369
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:31,380
You've been traveling for days.

370
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,290
You're exhausted.

371
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,660
Get through tonight,

372
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:36,530
and everything will be back to normal.

373
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:42,980
I failed to protect you.

374
00:22:43,750 --> 00:22:44,700
None of this

375
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:46,620
should ever have happened.

376
00:23:44,310 --> 00:23:45,620
This love has endured for a thousand years.

377
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:47,940
They met again, yet didn't recognize each other.

378
00:23:48,550 --> 00:23:50,290
How can their feelings still burn so fiercely?

379
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:52,490
This spell won't hold them back for long.

380
00:23:53,590 --> 00:23:55,250
Luckily, it won't take too long.

381
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:57,380
Soon, we'll both be free.

382
00:24:00,580 --> 00:24:10,860
[Luoshen Residence]

383
00:24:14,140 --> 00:24:17,580
[Luoshen Residence]

384
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:25,380
Move.

385
00:24:27,510 --> 00:24:28,900
You don't belong here.

386
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,220
And she doesn't want to see you.

387
00:24:30,830 --> 00:24:31,770
Whether she wants to see me

388
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,290
isn't for you to decide.

389
00:25:02,590 --> 00:25:04,250
He broke the Wanjun Lock's seal.

390
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:07,330
His power really has grown beyond what it once was.

391
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:11,290
Why did you stop me?

392
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:14,660
Yamao is furious with you right now.

393
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:17,010
If you actually hurt Danshen,

394
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,770
she'll never forgive you!

395
00:25:21,750 --> 00:25:22,770
I still have to see her.

396
00:25:23,350 --> 00:25:24,500
What good will seeing her

397
00:25:24,500 --> 00:25:25,620
do right now?

398
00:25:26,270 --> 00:25:27,290
She's already made herself

399
00:25:27,310 --> 00:25:28,380
perfectly clear!

400
00:25:29,030 --> 00:25:30,480
You knew the mystical flower's bloom

401
00:25:30,480 --> 00:25:31,420
would kill her.

402
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:32,700
Yet you kept it from her

403
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,460
and still wanted to keep watering it.

404
00:25:35,310 --> 00:25:36,570
Do you actually want...

405
00:25:40,750 --> 00:25:42,490
Do you really want Yamao to die?

406
00:25:45,030 --> 00:25:46,620
How could I ever let her die?

407
00:25:47,110 --> 00:25:48,570
Then what's really going on?

408
00:25:52,480 --> 00:25:52,860
My Lord,

409
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:54,420
what exactly are you planning?

410
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:55,570
I promise

411
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,090
I won't tell a soul.

412
00:26:09,220 --> 00:26:12,060
[Luoshen Residence]

413
00:26:15,750 --> 00:26:17,140
There he goes again, keeping everything to himself.

414
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:18,490
Whatever he's planning,

415
00:26:18,510 --> 00:26:19,810
no one's going to end up happy.

416
00:26:20,350 --> 00:26:21,010
I don't care

417
00:26:21,030 --> 00:26:22,330
if he's caught between two impossible choices.

418
00:26:22,830 --> 00:26:23,660
If he won't say anything,

419
00:26:24,270 --> 00:26:25,250
then I'll tell Yamao myself...

420
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:31,900
I'll tell Yamao that he's...

421
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:36,290
He even put a silencing spell on me!

422
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,770
What good does keeping me in the dark do?

423
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:42,730
If he keeps this up,

424
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:44,090
Yamao will hate him forever.

425
00:26:44,750 --> 00:26:47,330
Why is he so obsessed with that stupid flower?

426
00:26:58,140 --> 00:27:00,620
[Calming Mantra | History of the Upper Immortal Realm, Vol. 2]

427
00:27:05,270 --> 00:27:06,050
Master.

428
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:11,330
Since when

429
00:27:11,590 --> 00:27:12,900
have you been interested in these books?

430
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,570
I wasn't skilled enough before.

431
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:16,090
I nearly died several times.

432
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,570
Now that things are back to normal,

433
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:19,250
I figured I'd better

434
00:27:19,310 --> 00:27:20,220
study and train harder.

435
00:27:20,510 --> 00:27:21,250
But Master,

436
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:22,940
why are you in the library so late?

437
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:24,220
There's something

438
00:27:24,510 --> 00:27:25,180
I came to see you about.

439
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:33,010
Is this...

440
00:27:33,350 --> 00:27:34,090
You made it to look like me?

441
00:27:34,350 --> 00:27:34,770
Yes.

442
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,220
It's made from the same fabric

443
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:37,290
as your doll.

444
00:27:38,030 --> 00:27:39,900
I also put my own marriage thread

445
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:41,050
inside it.

446
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:48,810
Master never saw me

447
00:27:48,830 --> 00:27:49,660
make that doll.

448
00:27:50,110 --> 00:27:51,900
H-How could you...

449
00:27:52,310 --> 00:27:53,460
How could you know about it?

450
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:55,530
I saw it once on Mount Zhaowu.

451
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:56,730
Besides,

452
00:27:57,030 --> 00:27:58,250
when I turned into a soul crystal,

453
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,170
I was exhausted,

454
00:27:59,170 --> 00:28:00,090
not dead.

455
00:28:00,550 --> 00:28:02,290
I remember everything that happened.

456
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:03,680
I know now

457
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:04,700
how disrespectful it was.

458
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:05,460
I-I...

459
00:28:05,550 --> 00:28:07,220
Please forgive me just this once, Master.

460
00:28:07,590 --> 00:28:08,530
Please don't be angry.

461
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,810
Why would I be angry with you?

462
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:15,940
I never imagined

463
00:28:16,310 --> 00:28:17,530
being with someone forever.

464
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:20,490
But Yamao,

465
00:28:22,070 --> 00:28:23,140
if that's what you've always wished for,

466
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:25,620
I'll do whatever it takes to make it happen.

467
00:28:29,790 --> 00:28:31,570
The Wish Tree will soon appear.

468
00:28:32,510 --> 00:28:33,530
Rest for a few more days.

469
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:36,050
Then we'll go to Luoliang Immortal City.

470
00:28:42,030 --> 00:28:43,860
Isn't this what I've always dreamed of?

471
00:28:45,270 --> 00:28:46,250
Then why

472
00:28:47,750 --> 00:28:48,700
can't I feel happy?

473
00:28:57,790 --> 00:28:58,370
Youyou?

474
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:01,300
You...

475
00:29:01,550 --> 00:29:02,040
Come with me.

476
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:04,040
His Lordship is waiting outside Luoshen Valley.

477
00:29:04,110 --> 00:29:04,970
It's your master who's stopping

478
00:29:04,970 --> 00:29:05,810
the two of you from meeting.

479
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,210
I know he's outside.

480
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:09,660
I'm the one who doesn't want to see him.

481
00:29:10,550 --> 00:29:11,490
You've got him all wrong.

482
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:12,770
He never wanted to kill you.

483
00:29:13,310 --> 00:29:14,090
I've got him wrong?

484
00:29:14,510 --> 00:29:15,810
Didn't he lie to me?

485
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:17,770
Are you saying the mystical flower

486
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:18,660
isn't draining my life

487
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,760
to keep itself alive?

488
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:20,420
He knew.

489
00:29:20,420 --> 00:29:20,810
But...

490
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,140
When he watered the flower

491
00:29:23,140 --> 00:29:24,050
in Luoliang Demon Capital,

492
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:25,460
didn't he know it would kill me?

493
00:29:25,460 --> 00:29:26,810
He knew that too, but...

494
00:29:27,070 --> 00:29:28,490
Are you saying he didn't

495
00:29:28,550 --> 00:29:29,250
choose the flower in the end?

496
00:29:30,790 --> 00:29:32,010
Here's what really happened...

497
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:37,660
What are you doing now?

498
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:39,380
Enough.

499
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:40,860
I don't want to talk about this anymore.

500
00:29:46,480 --> 00:29:47,810
Why are you taking back your marriage thread?

501
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,180
So you do know

502
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,460
it's my marriage thread.

503
00:29:51,070 --> 00:29:51,970
You've kept it

504
00:29:51,970 --> 00:29:52,620
long enough.

505
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:54,140
It's time you gave it back.

506
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:56,730
My master told me

507
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,660
the Wish Tree will appear soon.

508
00:29:59,070 --> 00:30:00,700
I'm going with him to Luoliang Immortal City.

509
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:05,980
Are you really going to

510
00:30:06,030 --> 00:30:07,050
abandon His Lordship and me now?

511
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:09,660
Qi Fengyin

512
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,140
was once

513
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:12,220
a dear friend I truly cared about.

514
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,380
But he was willing to sacrifice my life

515
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,620
to make that mystical flower bloom!

516
00:30:17,270 --> 00:30:18,530
Going to the Wish Tree with my master

517
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,330
has been my lifelong dream.

518
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,010
I've always respected and loved him.

519
00:30:22,310 --> 00:30:23,810
Now he wants to spend his life with me.

520
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:25,010
What's wrong with that?

521
00:30:26,070 --> 00:30:27,660
Are you sure your master

522
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:28,860
is the only one you care about?

523
00:30:31,350 --> 00:30:32,380
I've never been more clearheaded.

524
00:30:33,110 --> 00:30:34,010
I know exactly

525
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:34,980
who truly cares about me

526
00:30:35,350 --> 00:30:36,180
and who wants me dead.

527
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,600
Now that I've got

528
00:30:38,600 --> 00:30:39,460
my marriage thread back,

529
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:41,220
you can keep the doll's body.

530
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:43,460
The immortal energy in Luoshen Valley isn't good for you.

531
00:30:43,830 --> 00:30:45,140
Go back to Qi Fengyin.

532
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:47,180
If you ever need my help,

533
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:48,420
I won't turn my back on you.

534
00:30:48,830 --> 00:30:49,660
But as for this,

535
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:51,220
don't try to change my mind.

536
00:30:53,790 --> 00:30:54,620
Have you lost your mind?

537
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:56,560
Anyone with eyes

538
00:30:56,560 --> 00:30:57,300
can see

539
00:30:57,300 --> 00:30:58,570
you're in love with His Lordship!

540
00:30:58,920 --> 00:31:00,290
What are you even saying?

541
00:31:00,590 --> 00:31:01,940
You're just taking your anger out on us!

542
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:03,380
Taking my anger out on you?

543
00:31:05,070 --> 00:31:05,730
I've told you.

544
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,140
I want nothing more to do

545
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:07,980
with Qi Fengyin.

546
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,290
All I want now

547
00:31:09,640 --> 00:31:10,940
is to stay by my master's side.

548
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:12,810
And you?

549
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,730
You can force me to see Qi Fengyin,

550
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:16,660
but can you make him give up the flower?

551
00:31:16,830 --> 00:31:17,250
I...

552
00:31:26,350 --> 00:31:27,770
That ugly hairpin of yours broke.

553
00:31:30,590 --> 00:31:31,420
His Lordship

554
00:31:31,510 --> 00:31:32,660
carved this one himself for you.

555
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,180
Take good care of it.

556
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:39,620
And another thing.

557
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:40,870
The way you're acting

558
00:31:40,870 --> 00:31:41,940
isn't normal at all.

559
00:31:42,070 --> 00:31:43,400
You haven't even figured out

560
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,860
what you truly want.

561
00:31:47,550 --> 00:31:47,900
Youyou!

562
00:31:48,070 --> 00:31:48,660
What?

563
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:51,330
Use the door.

564
00:31:52,070 --> 00:31:53,010
I don't like using doors!

565
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:11,860
Stop waiting.

566
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,620
Yamao said she won't see you,

567
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:14,980
and she means it.

568
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:22,390
For the past thousand years,

569
00:33:22,390 --> 00:33:23,700
you've hated that mystical flower.

570
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:25,650
How could one recovered memory

571
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,380
suddenly make you fall in love with it?

572
00:33:28,750 --> 00:33:30,810
So what if I have no feelings for the flower?

573
00:33:31,790 --> 00:33:32,940
I made a promise

574
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:33,900
to bring it back to life.

575
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:37,980
That obsession is now part of who I am.

576
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:39,860
Even if love and hate have nothing to do with it,

577
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:42,530
I still need to know why.

578
00:33:42,830 --> 00:33:43,220
Well, there you have it.

579
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:44,620
On one hand,

580
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,530
you can't let go of Yamao.

581
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,310
On the other,

582
00:33:46,310 --> 00:33:47,420
you can't give up that stupid flower.

583
00:33:47,550 --> 00:33:49,180
You can't have it both ways.

584
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:51,000
Until you tell Yamao the truth,

585
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,330
she'll never forgive you.

586
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:53,530
Even if I tell her,

587
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:54,980
she won't agree to it.

588
00:33:55,070 --> 00:33:56,460
So you already know that.

589
00:33:57,110 --> 00:33:58,380
Then why are you still here,

590
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:59,380
insisting on seeing her?

591
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:03,050
Because I want to see her.

592
00:34:07,110 --> 00:34:07,530
Oh, no.

593
00:34:09,030 --> 00:34:09,610
Oh, no. This is bad.

594
00:34:11,150 --> 00:34:11,940
You're in love with her.

595
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:14,300
But what good will that do you?

596
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,460
She and her master love each other.

597
00:34:16,630 --> 00:34:17,330
Before long,

598
00:34:17,330 --> 00:34:18,260
they'll go to Luoliang Immortal City

599
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:19,170
to get married.

600
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:20,940
As long as that flower exists,

601
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:22,340
you two are doomed.

602
00:34:22,710 --> 00:34:23,340
Even Yamao and I

603
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,480
can see that.

604
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:25,900
Why can't you?

605
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:27,040
From now on,

606
00:34:27,040 --> 00:34:28,490
I'll pray three times every morning and night

607
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:30,050
that you two never see each other again!

608
00:34:30,190 --> 00:34:30,900
After all,

609
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:31,430
aren't you both

610
00:34:31,430 --> 00:34:32,290
better off apart?

611
00:34:59,670 --> 00:35:00,340
He's still not leaving?

612
00:35:15,550 --> 00:35:16,940
Why does my chest still feel so tight,

613
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,490
no matter how much I rest?

614
00:35:20,150 --> 00:35:20,980
I can barely breathe.

615
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:24,780
But I'm not

616
00:35:24,840 --> 00:35:25,650
sad anymore.

617
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:30,300
Maybe I just need more rest.

618
00:35:53,880 --> 00:35:54,420
Don't go.

619
00:35:56,070 --> 00:35:57,340
Why won't you leave me alone?

620
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:59,010
Now you're using the dark mark

621
00:35:59,030 --> 00:35:59,740
to enter my dreams?

622
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:00,820
Entering your dreams

623
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:02,800
isn't something I can do alone.

624
00:36:04,150 --> 00:36:05,740
We both have to be thinking of each other,

625
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:07,090
day and night,

626
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:08,980
for our spirits to connect.

627
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:11,050
Thinking of each other?

628
00:36:13,030 --> 00:36:14,340
Even if I can't stop thinking about you,

629
00:36:15,110 --> 00:36:16,210
it's only because I hate you!

630
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,210
What good is forcing me to stay?

631
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,130
This is just a dream.

632
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:32,860
It's an illusion.

633
00:36:33,070 --> 00:36:34,010
None of this is real.

634
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,300
But you are.

635
00:36:42,070 --> 00:36:42,780
Qi Fengyin.

636
00:36:43,630 --> 00:36:44,740
Who are you trying to fool

637
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:45,530
with that look?

638
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,170
Do you think

639
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:49,300
I'm still the fool who believed your lies?

640
00:36:50,230 --> 00:36:51,300
You'll never fool me again.

641
00:36:53,670 --> 00:36:55,040
You've already made your choice

642
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:55,820
between me and the mystical flower.

643
00:36:56,590 --> 00:36:57,740
You don't care if I live or die.

644
00:36:59,190 --> 00:37:00,050
But I do.

645
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:03,210
Nine hundred years ago,

646
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:04,740
Youyou asked me

647
00:37:05,710 --> 00:37:06,740
what I'd do if someone

648
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:07,860
I trusted completely

649
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,170
betrayed me.

650
00:37:09,630 --> 00:37:10,490
I had no answer.

651
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,090
Now I finally know

652
00:37:12,110 --> 00:37:13,260
exactly how that feels.

653
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:17,210
Take out your anger on me however you want.

654
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:18,340
I don't want to vent my anger.

655
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,380
I want us

656
00:37:23,070 --> 00:37:24,050
to owe each other nothing.

657
00:37:36,230 --> 00:37:36,900
Qi Fengyin.

658
00:37:38,710 --> 00:37:39,300
Do you know

659
00:37:40,190 --> 00:37:41,260
how someone can force themselves

660
00:37:41,260 --> 00:37:42,340
to wake up from a dream?

661
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,690
Yamao...

662
00:38:03,070 --> 00:38:03,740
From now on,

663
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:06,090
every time you enter my dreams,

664
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,820
I'll die right in front of you.

665
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,210
Until you finally give up.

666
00:38:31,190 --> 00:38:32,530
She said she was afraid of pain and death.

667
00:38:33,710 --> 00:38:34,900
Yet she'd rather do that

668
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:35,490
to wake herself up.

669
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,780
Why do I keep forcing her to see me?

670
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:41,570
Is Youyou right?

671
00:38:42,230 --> 00:38:43,650
Have I fallen for her?

672
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:46,610
Or am I just confused,

673
00:38:47,550 --> 00:38:49,530
mistaking Yamao for the mystical flower?

674
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,980
Even if it takes my entire life,

675
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,260
no matter what the cost,

676
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:21,130
I swear I'll bring you back to life.

677
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:30,900
I'm bound by a promise.

678
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,090
I still haven't uncovered the truth about my past.

679
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:34,740
My life isn't mine to live freely.

680
00:39:35,550 --> 00:39:37,490
What right do I have to explore these feelings?

681
00:39:38,230 --> 00:39:39,170
Everything I've been through

682
00:39:39,190 --> 00:39:40,340
since leaving Mount Qihuang

683
00:39:41,230 --> 00:39:42,610
and entering this world

684
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:44,740
has been for the mystical flower.

685
00:39:46,150 --> 00:39:49,170
Reclaiming the world's malice comes first.

686
00:39:51,880 --> 00:39:53,340
You've made your choice.

687
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:58,380
And I have things I need to do, too.

688
00:40:09,070 --> 00:40:09,940
Where are you going?

689
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:11,610
Have you finally come to your senses?

690
00:40:12,630 --> 00:40:13,570
You're not waiting for Yamao anymore?

691
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:16,090
I'm going after the last wisp of malice.

692
00:40:18,110 --> 00:40:19,300
You were better off

693
00:40:19,300 --> 00:40:20,420
staying here and refusing to budge.

694
00:40:20,550 --> 00:40:21,410
After all this,

695
00:40:21,410 --> 00:40:22,780
you're still trying to revive that flower?

696
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,170
Is one promise really worth all this?

697
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:26,090
It is.

698
00:40:27,920 --> 00:40:29,300
So much of my past

699
00:40:30,070 --> 00:40:32,010
is tangled up in lies and half-truths.

700
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,210
Only by restoring the Devil's Heart

701
00:40:37,150 --> 00:40:39,820
can I uncover what really happened.

702
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:45,980
You're not thinking straight.

703
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:47,010
I'd better stick close to you

704
00:40:47,110 --> 00:40:48,080
before you do something

705
00:40:48,080 --> 00:40:48,900
you'll regret.

706
00:40:49,030 --> 00:40:49,980
I'll use my compass to help you.

707
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:50,780
No need.

708
00:41:04,510 --> 00:41:05,090
My Lord.

709
00:41:05,590 --> 00:41:06,340
Your powers

710
00:41:06,340 --> 00:41:07,610
have grown so strong already?

711
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:09,900
You can sense

712
00:41:09,920 --> 00:41:10,940
every trace of good and evil in every living soul.

713
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:28,980
Yinhua.

714
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:30,940
I brought you some books

715
00:41:31,510 --> 00:41:32,980
and a few interesting magical artifacts.

716
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:34,260
They're not particularly useful,

717
00:41:34,670 --> 00:41:35,740
but they might help pass the time.

718
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:43,610
You shouldn't keep coming here.

719
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,050
Yinhua.

720
00:41:54,230 --> 00:41:55,570
There's something very important I need to ask you.

721
00:41:56,150 --> 00:41:57,340
I need you to answer me honestly.

722
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:00,900
Earlier,

723
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:03,010
when you reopened the blood pool and practiced forbidden arts,

724
00:42:04,110 --> 00:42:04,820
was it

725
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:06,940
because the Saintess of the Tides forced you?

726
00:42:07,110 --> 00:42:08,690
Why are you asking me this now?

727
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:11,780
How dare you question the Saintess?

728
00:42:12,030 --> 00:42:12,740
That woman

729
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:13,900
isn't the real Saintess of the Tides!

730
00:42:15,590 --> 00:42:16,260
What?

731
00:42:17,070 --> 00:42:18,170
Hao and our master...

732
00:42:18,480 --> 00:42:19,690
We were all deceived.

733
00:42:20,510 --> 00:42:22,210
She's just a mystical seed that took human form.

734
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:25,130
No wonder.

735
00:42:25,630 --> 00:42:26,690
She claimed to be a goddess,

736
00:42:27,280 --> 00:42:29,130
yet resorted to such vile methods

737
00:42:29,510 --> 00:42:30,610
to gain power.

738
00:42:31,070 --> 00:42:32,740
But why would she attack the immortal sects?

739
00:42:35,190 --> 00:42:36,170
We don't know who she really is

740
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,170
or what she's after.

741
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:39,380
Yinhua.

742
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:40,940
What matters most now

743
00:42:41,190 --> 00:42:42,530
is that Hao has agreed

744
00:42:43,230 --> 00:42:43,820
to hold another hearing

745
00:42:44,150 --> 00:42:45,130
for your sake.

746
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:46,420
When the time comes,

747
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:48,210
just tell everyone the truth.

748
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:49,210
Make sure they know

749
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,210
everything you did before

750
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:51,820
was because the Saintess of the Tides

751
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:53,460
forced you to do it.

752
00:42:54,960 --> 00:42:57,420
You might get a lighter punishment.

753
00:42:58,510 --> 00:42:59,690
And once I'm released,

754
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:02,010
where would I go?

755
00:43:03,400 --> 00:43:05,980
Now that everyone knows I'm a woman,

756
00:43:06,840 --> 00:43:08,460
I can no longer stay on Mount Zhaowu.

757
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:10,420
Once you're free again,

758
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:12,090
does it matter where you go?

759
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:17,380
You don't understand.

760
00:43:19,110 --> 00:43:20,170
Even if I die,

761
00:43:21,480 --> 00:43:22,860
I want to die on Mount Zhaowu.

762
00:43:25,030 --> 00:43:26,010
Some things

763
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:29,690
will never change.

764
00:43:44,280 --> 00:43:45,170
How is she doing?

765
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:46,460
Same as before.

766
00:43:47,480 --> 00:43:48,460
Thank you for giving me permission

767
00:43:48,800 --> 00:43:50,260
to visit Yinhua more often.

768
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:53,010
Once I've finished these matters,

769
00:43:53,400 --> 00:43:54,690
I'll enter seclusion in the Sword Pavilion

770
00:43:55,630 --> 00:43:56,980
and use the divine power the Saintess left behind

771
00:43:57,710 --> 00:43:58,740
to forge the Demon-Slaying Sword.

772
00:43:59,030 --> 00:43:59,650
I get it.

773
00:44:00,230 --> 00:44:00,980
I'll handle

774
00:44:01,400 --> 00:44:02,570
the sect's affairs while you're away.

775
00:44:03,480 --> 00:44:04,380
Our top priority

776
00:44:05,320 --> 00:44:06,570
is finding the Immortal Sect Token.

777
00:44:07,440 --> 00:44:07,940
Until

778
00:44:08,280 --> 00:44:09,300
we recover it,

779
00:44:09,630 --> 00:44:10,210
the immortal sects

780
00:44:11,280 --> 00:44:12,420
will never be at peace.

781
00:44:13,480 --> 00:44:13,940
Yes.

782
00:44:26,920 --> 00:44:28,740
The immortal sects are all hunting you.

783
00:44:29,510 --> 00:44:30,210
Yet you dare

784
00:44:30,230 --> 00:44:32,340
use the Immortal Sect Token to sneak in here?

785
00:44:33,280 --> 00:44:34,690
You clearly have

786
00:44:34,760 --> 00:44:35,570
no respect for Mount Zhaowu.

787
00:44:36,070 --> 00:44:38,210
You're locked away deep in Wuchang Prison,

788
00:44:39,960 --> 00:44:41,170
yet you seem to know

789
00:44:41,190 --> 00:44:42,490
everything happening outside.

790
00:44:47,760 --> 00:44:49,210
You're not the Saintess of the Tides.

791
00:44:50,320 --> 00:44:51,420
Why are you impersonating her?

792
00:44:51,880 --> 00:44:53,210
Who I am doesn't matter.

793
00:44:54,400 --> 00:44:55,900
What matters is that I'm here

794
00:44:55,960 --> 00:44:56,940
to make you an offer.

795
00:44:57,230 --> 00:44:57,940
An offer?

796
00:44:58,510 --> 00:45:00,170
After everything I did for you,

797
00:45:00,550 --> 00:45:01,940
look where I ended up.

798
00:45:02,190 --> 00:45:03,340
What makes you think

799
00:45:03,880 --> 00:45:04,820
I'd ever help you again?

800
00:45:05,150 --> 00:45:06,050
Because you'll get

801
00:45:06,050 --> 00:45:07,610
what you've always dreamed of.

802
00:45:11,230 --> 00:45:12,090
And I'll finally achieve

803
00:45:12,110 --> 00:45:12,980
what I truly want.

804
00:45:13,920 --> 00:45:15,210
Looks like you've

805
00:45:16,030 --> 00:45:17,530
run out of allies.

806
00:45:18,070 --> 00:45:19,420
You're so desperate

807
00:45:20,030 --> 00:45:21,650
you're asking a prisoner for help.

808
00:45:27,440 --> 00:45:29,170
This is a love-binding parasite from the divine realm.

809
00:45:30,360 --> 00:45:31,690
One drop of your blood

810
00:45:31,800 --> 00:45:32,610
will bind it to you.

811
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:35,690
Plant it inside Yuwen Hao,

812
00:45:36,760 --> 00:45:38,610
and all his feelings for Yamao

813
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:41,210
will be transferred to you.

814
00:45:41,760 --> 00:45:42,820
From then on,

815
00:45:43,400 --> 00:45:45,260
the stronger his bond with Yamao,

816
00:45:46,070 --> 00:45:47,130
the more he'll love you.

817
00:45:48,880 --> 00:45:49,820
It's yours if you want it.

818
00:45:59,590 --> 00:46:00,860
I don't want that parasite.

819
00:46:04,760 --> 00:46:05,650
I've already

820
00:46:06,840 --> 00:46:08,010
taken innocent lives

821
00:46:09,110 --> 00:46:10,260
and committed countless crimes.

822
00:46:10,760 --> 00:46:12,820
My name is ruined among the immortal sects.

823
00:46:13,440 --> 00:46:14,460
Making him fall in love with me

824
00:46:16,030 --> 00:46:17,260
would only hurt him.

825
00:46:22,400 --> 00:46:23,380
I know

826
00:46:24,190 --> 00:46:25,570
you're defying the will of Heaven

827
00:46:25,920 --> 00:46:26,980
by posing as the Saintess.

828
00:46:27,630 --> 00:46:29,260
Now that your divine power has been taken,

829
00:46:30,150 --> 00:46:31,940
your body is falling apart.

830
00:46:32,510 --> 00:46:33,610
You don't have long to live.

831
00:46:34,960 --> 00:46:36,260
I want you, in the end,

832
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:38,570
to die before the whole world

833
00:46:39,360 --> 00:46:41,300
at Hao's hands.

834
00:46:42,230 --> 00:46:44,610
Then he can rightfully inherit the Immortal Sect Token.

835
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:46,780
Hao is noble and honorable,

836
00:46:47,070 --> 00:46:48,170
unmatched by anyone.

837
00:46:48,710 --> 00:46:50,300
He deserves to stand

838
00:46:50,320 --> 00:46:51,210
above all the immortal sects.

839
00:46:52,150 --> 00:46:54,170
All you want is for him to rule the immortal sects?

840
00:46:54,670 --> 00:46:56,340
You don't want anything for yourself?

841
00:46:56,880 --> 00:46:57,460
And you?

842
00:46:59,480 --> 00:47:01,380
What do you stand to gain

843
00:47:02,630 --> 00:47:03,820
from making this deal with me?

844
00:47:05,030 --> 00:47:06,820
Are you still trying to take down Qi Fengyin?

845
00:47:08,550 --> 00:47:09,650
I never intended

846
00:47:11,030 --> 00:47:12,090
to kill Qi Fengyin.

847
00:47:29,630 --> 00:47:30,210
Qi Fengyin!

848
00:47:30,480 --> 00:47:31,340
Let go of my master!

849
00:47:31,550 --> 00:47:32,170
Take him.

850
00:47:34,190 --> 00:47:34,820
Master!

851
00:47:35,280 --> 00:47:36,190
What have you done to my master?

852
00:47:36,280 --> 00:47:37,260
I've turned him back

853
00:47:37,480 --> 00:47:38,940
into a stone, just like before.

854
00:47:39,320 --> 00:47:40,490
I should've killed you long ago.

855
